# Third-party notices

The random projection interface and sampling behavior are adapted from
scikit-learn and NumPy. The RNG code translates legacy MT19937, Gaussian,
binomial, and selection algorithms into Mojo. No third-party binary is used
by the library. These notices apply to the derived portions.

